<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO rates Norit a Buy.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO rates Norit a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Jan 10 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Norit	     Chemicals     24.20   ABN AMRO</p>
<p>COMMENT: BUY (reiterated). Norit has adopted a succesful diversification strategy. It has shifted its product mix from powdered carbon to granulated carbon, which yields higher profits. Norit had primarily been a producer of activated carbon, which accounted for 87 percent of sales. By 2000 sales of activated carbon will probably account for 50 percent of the total and an estimated 44 percent of operating income. New acquisitions will help boost earnings by 17 percent per year.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):    EPS	    P/E	 Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	 0.98	   19.3	0.42</p>
<p>    1996		    1.45	   16.8	0.60</p>
<p>    1997		    1.70	   14.1	0.70</p>
<p>    1998		    1.90	   12.7	0.80</p>
